#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:2
msgid "How to manage organization owners and teams"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../shared/admonition-rtd-business.rst:2
msgid ""
"This feature is only available on `Read the Docs Business <https://"
"app.readthedocs.com/>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:6
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses teams within an organization to group users and provide "
"permissions to projects. This guide will cover how to manage both "
"organization owners and team members. You can read more about organizations "
"and teams in our :doc:`/commercial/organizations` documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:11
msgid "Managing organization owners"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:13
msgid ""
"Organization owners have full administrative access to the organization and "
"all its projects. They can manage settings, teams, members, and other owners."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:17
msgid "Adding an owner to an organization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:19
msgid ""
"To grant someone full administrative access to your organization, add them "
"as an owner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:23
msgid "You must be an owner of the organization to add another owner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:25
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:41
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:62
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:75
msgid "Follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:27
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:43
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `organization management page <https://app.readthedocs.com/"
"organizations/choose/organization_detail/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:28
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:44
msgid "Select your organization from the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:29
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:45
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Owners`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:30
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:32
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Invite owner`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:31
msgid "Enter the user's Read the Docs username or email address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:34
msgid ""
"The user will receive an invitation and must accept it to become an owner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:37
msgid "Removing an owner from an organization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:39
msgid "To revoke administrative access from an organization owner:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:46
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove owner` next to the owner you want to remove."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:50
msgid ""
"You cannot remove the last owner from an organization. There must always be "
"at least one owner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:54
msgid "Managing team members"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:57
msgid "Adding a user to a team"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:59
msgid ""
"Adding a user to a team gives them all the permissions available to that "
"team, whether it's *read-only* or *admin*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:64
#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:77
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `teams management page <https://app.readthedocs.com/"
"organizations/choose/organization_team_list/>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:65
msgid "Click on a :guilabel:`<team name>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:66
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Invite Member`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:67
msgid "Input the user's Read the Docs username or email address."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:68
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add member`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:71
msgid "Removing a user from a team"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:73
msgid ""
"Removing a user from a team removes all permissions that team gave them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:78
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`<team name>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:79
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove` next to the user."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:83
msgid "Granting access to import a project"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:85
msgid ""
"Organization owners can import projects on any team. To let another user "
"import projects, make them a member of any team with *admin* permissions, "
"they will be granted access to import a project on that team."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../guides/manage-read-the-docs-teams.rst:90
msgid ""
"If your organization uses :ref:`single sign-on with a Git provider "
"<sso_git_provider>`, teams aren't used, and only organization owners can "
"import projects."
msgstr ""

